{"prefectureId":"11","cities":{"11101":[{"id":"11101:national:5febeafd9fd0","cityId":"11101","category":"歴史","text":"さいたま市西区の名は、市域の西に位置することに由来します。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%A5%BF%E5%8C%BA+%28%E3%81%95%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E3%81%BE%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=110543399"}],"11102":[{"id":"11102:national:4db98f595d49","cityId":"11102","category":"地理・自然","text":"さいたま市北区はさいたま市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8C%97%E5%8C%BA+%28%E3%81%95%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E3%81%BE%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=111399581"}],"11103":[{"id":"11103:national:4076a491e7a5","cityId":"11103","category":"地理・自然","text":"さいたま市大宮区はさいたま市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%A4%A7%E5%AE%AE%E5%8C%BA&oldid=110536589"}],"11104":[{"id":"11104:national:dbb94ff77087","cityId":"11104","category":"地理・自然","text":"さいたま市見沼区はさいたま市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E8%A6%8B%E6%B2%BC%E5%8C%BA&oldid=111399569"}],"11105":[{"id":"11105:national:978c588ec4ff","cityId":"11105","category":"地理・自然","text":"さいたま市中央区はさいたま市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%8C%BA+%28%E3%81%95%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E3%81%BE%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=107488427"}],"11106":[{"id":"11106:national:40bf76dcc35a","cityId":"11106","category":"地理・自然","text":"さいたま市桜区はさいたま市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%A1%9C%E5%8C%BA&oldid=107189512"}],"11107":[{"id":"11107:national:8b4854746241","cityId":"11107","category":"地理・自然","text":"さいたま市浦和区はさいたま市にある行政区です。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E6%B5%A6%E5%92%8C%E5%8C%BA&oldid=110308200"}],"11108":[{"id":"11108:national:8115f15348fd","cityId":"11108","category":"地理・自然","text":"区の北側は浦和区に面しており、旧浦和市の中心市街地に近接しています。","source":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?title=%E5%8D%97%E5%8C%BA+%28%E3%81%95%E3%81%84%E3%81%9F%E3%81%BE%E5%B8%82%29&oldid=109816304"},{"id":"11108:national:d897c2a2262e","cityId":"11108","category":"地理・自然","t